        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6541 Mortise San Francisco Entry Set with 5020 Colonial Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, the Baldwin made San Francisco 6541 Mortise has a lifetime limited warranty on the workmanship, materials, and operation. It is finished in PVD Polished Brass which also is backed by a lifetime limited warranty. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". Available in single cylinder, double cylinder, and dummy set functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/colonial-knobset-baldwin-5020\"<b>Matching 5020 Colonial Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6541 San Francisco Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estate Collection San Francisco Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>PVD Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5020 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Length: 11.875\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .312\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.468\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6541.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>San Fransico Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates entrance set latch; while from the interior, it is operated by a knob. The deadbolt is operated by a key from both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-3-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354505\" width=\"350\" height=\"125\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\"></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "San Francisco Mortise Entrance Set, Baldwin 6541",
                "description": "Baldwin 6541 San Francisco Entry Set - Made out of solid brass, the Baldwin made San Fransico 6541 Mortise has a lifetime limited warranty on the workmanship, materials, and operation. It is finished in PVD Polished Brass which also is backed by a lifetime limited warranty. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in single cylinder, double cylinder, and dummy set functions.",
                "keywords": "baldwin 6541, BAL-6541, bladwin San Francisco entrance sets, baldwin San Francisco Francisco entrysets, colonial entry sets, traditional entry sets, solid brass entrysets, mortise entrysets, mortise entrance sets, mortise handlesets, single cylinder entrance sets, double cylinder entrance sets, traditional front door hardware, baldwin estate collection entry sets, baldwin estates collection entrance sets, baldwin ornate entrance sets,"
            },
